{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08105","headline":"空城雀 · 李白","name":"空城雀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嗷嗷空城雀，身计何戚促。\n本与鹪鹩羣，不随凤凰族。\n提携四黄口，饮乳未尝足。\n食君糠粃余，尝恐乌鸢逐。\n耻涉太行险，羞营覆车粟。\n天命有定端，守分绝所欲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}